Package: a11yviz
Title: Accessibility Toolkit for 'ggplot2', 'plotly', and 'Quarto'
Version: 0.1.4
Authors@R:
    person("Mikyung", "Shin", , "shin.mikyung@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7907-9193", affiliation = "Illinois State University"))
Description: Makes charts and documents accessible across 'ggplot2',
    'plotly', and 'Quarto', aligned with the Web Content Accessibility
    Guidelines (WCAG 2.1, <https://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG21/>). Includes
    WCAG-tagged palettes, alt-text scaffolds, audits, a document
    rubric, heading and reading-level checks, 'shiny' ARIA helpers,
    and a drop-in stylesheet for 'DT' and 'DiagrammeR', as employed
    in Shin et al. (2026) <doi:10.1177/07319487251412879>.
